{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","tactics":["lateral-movement"],"description":"Adversaries may use Valid Accounts to log into a service that accepts remote connections, such as telnet, SSH, and VNC. The adversary may then perform actions as the logged-on user. In an enterprise environment, servers and workstations can be organized into domains. Domains provide centralized identity management, allowing users to login using one set of credentials across the entire network. If an adversary is able to obtain a set of valid domain credentials, they could login to many different machines using remote access protocols such as secure shell (SSH) or remote desktop protocol (RDP).","status":"paper_only","claimed_by":[{"id":"CIS-4.7","title":""},{"id":"CIS-5.3","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.1","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.2","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.4","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.5","title":""}],"live_rules":[],"dead_rules":[{"id":"22777c9e-873a-4b49-855f-6072ab861a52","title":"OpenCanary - SMB File Open Request","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]},{"id":"6991bc2b-ae2e-447f-bc55-3a1ba04c14e5","title":"OpenCanary - FTP Login Attempt","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]},{"id":"730fc21b-eaff-474b-ad23-90fd265d4988","title":"Psexec Execution","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"8a3038e8-9c9d-46f8-b184-66234a160f6f","title":"Potential Remote Desktop Tunneling","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"9bd04a79-dabe-4f1f-a5ff-92430265c96b","title":"Privilege Escalation via Named Pipe Impersonation","level":"high","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"9db5446c-b44a-4291-8b89-fcab5609c3b3","title":"OpenCanary - VNC Connection Attempt","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]},{"id":"cd55f721-5623-4663-bd9b-5229cab5237d","title":"OpenCanary - SSH New Connection Attempt","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]},{"id":"e9856028-fd4e-46e6-b3d1-10f7ceb95078","title":"OpenCanary - SNMP OID Request","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]},{"id":"ff7139bc-fdb1-4437-92f2-6afefe8884cb","title":"OpenCanary - SSH Login Attempt","level":"high","requires":["opencanary/application"]}],"subtechniques":[{"id":"T1021.001","name":"Remote Services: Remote Desktop Protocol","status":"defended"},{"id":"T1021.002","name":"Remote Services: SMB/Windows Admin Shares","status":"defended"},{"id":"T1021.003","name":"Remote Services: Distributed Component Object Model","status":"defended"},{"id":"T1021.004","name":"Remote Services: SSH","status":"paper_only"},{"id":"T1021.005","name":"Remote Services: VNC","status":"paper_only"},{"id":"T1021.006","name":"Remote Services: Windows Remote Management","status":"paper_only"},{"id":"T1021.007","name":"Remote Services: Cloud Services","status":"detected_only"},{"id":"T1021.008","name":"Remote Services: Direct Cloud VM Connections","status":"blind"}]}